    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d57">

                <pb facs="0203" n="833" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg833"/>

                <head>No. 363.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation in Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 16, 1872</date>.
                        (Received Jan. 6, 1873.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 507.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward herewith a
                    report, taken from the official gazette, of a discussion in the chamber of
                    deputies between the first minister of the crown and Mr. Estéban Collantes, a
                    conservative leader, touching colonial reform. A portion of the remarks of Mr.
                    Zorilla are translated.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>D. E. SICKLES.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d57-a1.xml" xpointer="d57-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
